{"seq":1,"slug":"no-std-fundamentals","title":"no_std 环境与裸机编程模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/embedded/no-std-fundamentals","wordCount":501,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"no_std-环境与裸机编程模型\">no_std 环境与裸机编程模型</h1><p>当目标是一块只有 32KB RAM、256KB Flash 的微控制器时，Rust 的标准库（依赖操作系统的堆分配、线程、文件系统）不再可用。<code>#![no_std]</code> 属性将 Rust 切换到裸机模式——只保留 <code>core</code> 库（纯算法和类型）和可选的 <code>alloc</code>（需自定义分配器）。这是嵌入式 Rust 的起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>no_std 环境剥离了 Rust 标准库中所有依赖操作系统的功能，但保留了语言的核心能力：所有权、借用检查、泛型、trait、模式匹配、迭代器。这意味着内存安全保证在裸机上同样有效。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[std 标准库] --&gt; B[alloc 堆分配]&#10;    A --&gt; C[OS 抽象: 线程/文件/网络]&#10;    B --&gt; D[core 核心库]&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    E[no_std 可用] --&gt; D&#10;    E --&gt; F[alloc 可选, 需自定义分配器]&#10;    G[不可用] --&gt; C&#10;    H[嵌入式目标] --&gt; E&#10;    I[核心能力保留] --&gt; J[所有权/借用/泛型/trait]&#10;    I --&gt; K[迭代器/Option/Result]&#10;    I --&gt; L[编译期计算/const fn]\">graph TD\n    A[std 标准库] --&gt; B[alloc 堆分配]\n    A --&gt; C[OS 抽象: 线程/文件/网络]\n    B --&gt; D[core 核心库]\n    C --&gt; D\n    E[no_std 可用] --&gt; D\n    E --&gt; F[alloc 可选, 需自定义分配器]\n    G[不可用] --&gt; C\n    H[嵌入式目标] --&gt; E\n    I[核心能力保留] --&gt; J[所有权/借用/泛型/trait]\n    I --&gt; K[迭代器/Option/Result]\n    I --&gt; L[编译期计算/const fn]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>库层级</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>no_std 可用性</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>core</code></td>\n<td>基本类型、trait、迭代器、原子操作</td>\n<td>始终可用</td>\n<td>所有裸机代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>alloc</code></td>\n<td>Vec、String、Box、Arc</td>\n<td>需提供 GlobalAlloc</td>\n<td>有堆的嵌入式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>std</code></td>\n<td>文件、网络、线程、进程</td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n<td>仅宿主系统</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"裸机入口点\">裸机入口点</h2><p>no_std 程序没有 <code>main</code> 函数（那需要 std 的运行时初始化）。取而代之的是 <code>#[no_mangle]</code> 的入口函数和 panic handler。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#![no_std]&#10;#![no_main]&#10;&#10;use core::panic::PanicInfo;&#10;&#10;// 链接器入口点——名称取决于链接脚本&#10;#[no_mangle]&#10;pub extern &quot;C&quot; fn _start() -&gt; ! {&#10;    // 初始化 .bss 段（清零）&#10;    extern &quot;C&quot; {&#10;        static mut __bss_start: u8;&#10;        static mut __bss_end: u8;&#10;    }&#10;    unsafe {&#10;        let bss_len = &amp;__bss_end as *const u8 as usize&#10;                    - &amp;__bss_start as *const u8 as usize;&#10;        core::ptr::write_bytes(&amp;mut __bss_start as *mut u8, 0, bss_len);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 应用逻辑&#10;    loop {&#10;        // 嵌入式主循环&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// panic 时的处理——嵌入式通常选择死循环或复位&#10;#[panic_handler]&#10;fn panic(_info: &amp;PanicInfo) -&gt; ! {&#10;    loop {}&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#![no_std]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#![no_main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use core::panic::PanicInfo;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 链接器入口点——名称取决于链接脚本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[no_mangle]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub extern \"C\" fn _start() -> ! {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 初始化 .bss 段（清零）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    extern \"C\" {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        static mut __bss_start: u8;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        static mut __bss_end: u8;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    unsafe {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let bss_len = &#x26;__bss_end as *const u8 as usize</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    - &#x26;__bss_start as *const u8 as usize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        core::ptr::write_bytes(&#x26;mut __bss_start as *mut u8, 0, bss_len);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 应用逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 嵌入式主循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// panic 时的处理——嵌入式通常选择死循环或复位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[panic_handler]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn panic(_info: &#x26;PanicInfo) -> ! {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loop {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"内存分配策略\">内存分配策略</h2><p>嵌入式系统中内存分配有三种主流策略，各有适用场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 策略 1: 纯静态分配——编译期确定所有内存使用&#10;static mut BUFFER: [u8; 1024] = [0; 1024];&#10;static SENSOR_DATA: heapless::Vec&lt;u16, 64&gt; = heapless::Vec::new();&#10;&#10;// 策略 2: 固定大小池分配器——适合频繁分配释放相同大小对象&#10;use heapless::pool::singleton::Pool;&#10;static PACKET_POOL: Pool&lt;[u8; 256]&gt; = Pool::new();&#10;&#10;// 策略 3: 自定义全局分配器——允许使用 alloc crate&#10;use core::alloc::{GlobalAlloc, Layout};&#10;&#10;struct BumpAllocator {&#10;    head: AtomicUsize,&#10;    end: usize,&#10;}&#10;&#10;unsafe impl GlobalAlloc for BumpAllocator {&#10;    unsafe fn alloc(&amp;self, layout: Layout) -&gt; *mut u8 {&#10;        let size = layout.size();&#10;        let align = layout.align();&#10;        loop {&#10;            let current = self.head.load(Ordering::Relaxed);&#10;            let aligned = (current + align - 1) &amp; !(align - 1);&#10;            let new_head = aligned + size;&#10;            if new_head &gt; self.end {&#10;                return core::ptr::null_mut();&#10;            }&#10;            if self.head.compare_exchange_weak(&#10;                current, new_head, Ordering::AcqRel, Ordering::Relaxed&#10;            ).is_ok() {&#10;                return aligned as *mut u8;&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    unsafe fn dealloc(&amp;self, _ptr: *mut u8, _layout: Layout) {&#10;        // Bump allocator 不释放单个对象&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 策略 1: 纯静态分配——编译期确定所有内存使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>static mut BUFFER: [u8; 1024] = [0; 1024];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>static SENSOR_DATA: heapless::Vec&#x3C;u16, 64> = heapless::Vec::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 策略 2: 固定大小池分配器——适合频繁分配释放相同大小对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use heapless::pool::singleton::Pool;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>static PACKET_POOL: Pool&#x3C;[u8; 256]> = Pool::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 策略 3: 自定义全局分配器——允许使用 alloc crate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use core::alloc::{GlobalAlloc, Layout};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct BumpAllocator {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    head: AtomicUsize,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end: usize,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unsafe impl GlobalAlloc for BumpAllocator {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    unsafe fn alloc(&#x26;self, layout: Layout) -> *mut u8 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let size = layout.size();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let align = layout.align();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let current = self.head.load(Ordering::Relaxed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let aligned = (current + align - 1) &#x26; !(align - 1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let new_head = aligned + size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if new_head > self.end {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return core::ptr::null_mut();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            if self.head.compare_exchange_weak(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                current, new_head, Ordering::AcqRel, Ordering::Relaxed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ).is_ok() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return aligned as *mut u8;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    unsafe fn dealloc(&#x26;self, _ptr: *mut u8, _layout: Layout) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // Bump allocator 不释放单个对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"heapless-数据结构\">heapless 数据结构</h2><p><code>heapless</code> crate 提供固定容量的集合类型，所有内存在栈或静态区分配。这是 no_std 环境中最常用的数据结构库。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use heapless::{Vec, String, FnvIndexMap, spsc::Queue};&#10;&#10;// 固定容量 Vec——超过容量返回 Err&#10;let mut readings: Vec&lt;u16, 128&gt; = Vec::new();&#10;readings.push(1023).unwrap();&#10;readings.push(512).unwrap();&#10;&#10;// 固定容量字符串&#10;let mut msg: String&lt;64&gt; = String::new();&#10;core::fmt::write(&amp;mut msg, format_args!(&quot;温度: {}°C&quot;, 25)).unwrap();&#10;&#10;// 单生产者单消费者队列——中断与主循环间通信&#10;static Q: Queue&lt;u8, 32&gt; = Queue::new();&#10;let (mut producer, mut consumer) = Q.split();&#10;producer.enqueue(42).ok();&#10;let val = consumer.dequeue();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use heapless::{Vec, String, FnvIndexMap, spsc::Queue};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 固定容量 Vec——超过容量返回 Err</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let mut readings: Vec&#x3C;u16, 128> = Vec::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>readings.push(1023).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>readings.push(512).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 固定容量字符串</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let mut msg: String&#x3C;64> = String::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>core::fmt::write(&#x26;mut msg, format_args!(\"温度: {}°C\", 25)).unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 单生产者单消费者队列——中断与主循环间通信</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>static Q: Queue&#x3C;u8, 32> = Queue::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let (mut producer, mut consumer) = Q.split();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>producer.enqueue(42).ok();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let val = consumer.dequeue();</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"链接脚本与内存映射\">链接脚本与内存映射</h2><p>裸机程序需要链接脚本（linker script）定义内存布局——Flash 的起始地址、RAM 的位置、中断向量表的放置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ld\" data-code=\"/* memory.x — STM32F4 示例 */&#10;MEMORY {&#10;    FLASH : ORIGIN = 0x08000000, LENGTH = 512K&#10;    RAM   : ORIGIN = 0x20000000, LENGTH = 128K&#10;}&#10;&#10;SECTIONS {&#10;    .vector_table ORIGIN(FLASH) : {&#10;        LONG(ORIGIN(RAM) + LENGTH(RAM));  /* 初始栈指针 */&#10;        KEEP(*(.vector_table.reset));     /* Reset handler */&#10;        KEEP(*(.vector_table.exceptions));&#10;    } &gt; FLASH&#10;&#10;    .text : { *(.text .text.*) } &gt; FLASH&#10;    .rodata : { *(.rodata .rodata.*) } &gt; FLASH&#10;&#10;    .data : {&#10;        __data_start = .;&#10;        *(.data .data.*)&#10;        __data_end = .;&#10;    } &gt; RAM AT &gt; FLASH&#10;&#10;    .bss (NOLOAD) : {&#10;        __bss_start = .;&#10;        *(.bss .bss.*)&#10;        __bss_end = .;&#10;    } &gt; RAM&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/* memory.x — STM32F4 示例 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>MEMORY {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    FLASH : ORIGIN = 0x08000000, LENGTH = 512K</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    RAM   : ORIGIN = 0x20000000, LENGTH = 128K</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>SECTIONS {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .vector_table ORIGIN(FLASH) : {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        LONG(ORIGIN(RAM) + LENGTH(RAM));  /* 初始栈指针 */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        KEEP(*(.vector_table.reset));     /* Reset handler */</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        KEEP(*(.vector_table.exceptions));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } > FLASH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .text : { *(.text .text.*) } > FLASH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .rodata : { *(.rodata .rodata.*) } > FLASH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .data : {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        __data_start = .;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        *(.data .data.*)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        __data_end = .;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } > RAM AT > FLASH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .bss (NOLOAD) : {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        __bss_start = .;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        *(.bss .bss.*)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        __bss_end = .;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    } > RAM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>#![no_std]</code> 剥离 OS 依赖但保留全部语言安全保证</li>\n<li>裸机入口需要手动初始化 .bss、设置 panic handler</li>\n<li>三种内存策略：纯静态、池分配器、自定义 GlobalAlloc</li>\n<li>heapless crate 提供固定容量集合，零堆分配</li>\n<li>链接脚本定义 Flash/RAM 布局和中断向量表位置</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章下一篇 <a href=\"embassy-async-embedded\">Embassy 异步嵌入式框架</a> 展示如何在 no_std 上运行 async/await</li>\n<li>跨库参考：<a href=\"../../rust-language/systems-programming/embedded-and-nostd\">Rust 语言 - 嵌入式与 no_std</a> 覆盖 no_std 的语言基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"no_std 环境与裸机编程模型","id":"no_std-环境与裸机编程模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"裸机入口点","id":"裸机入口点"},{"level":2,"text":"内存分配策略","id":"内存分配策略"},{"level":2,"text":"heapless 数据结构","id":"heapless-数据结构"},{"level":2,"text":"链接脚本与内存映射","id":"链接脚本与内存映射"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Rust for Linux 内核模块开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/systems/rust-for-linux-kernel"},"next":{"title":"Embassy 异步嵌入式框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/embedded/embassy-async-embedded"}}